{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b00c0919-cea8-888b-889a-3fc676dc03a1",
  "created_at": "2026-02-12T14:49:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marisa Rocha",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T14:46:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T14:46:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi hon, yes, hello. I'm calling about a puddle in the road, a big puddle in the road. It's been sitting there forever, sitting there forever."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T14:46:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, where is this? What street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T14:46:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's Callender Avenue, hon. Three fifty Callender, in the North End. Three fifty Callender, North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T14:46:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three fifty Callender Avenue. And is this flooding from a storm, or what's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T14:47:05-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no storm, that's the thing. It hasn't rained since last Thursday, since last Thursday, and it's still there. [line breaks up] Goes right across half the road, half the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T14:47:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up on me there. Half the road, you said?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T14:47:24-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Half the road, yeah. Right across from my house. And it just won't drain, won't drain. I figure the drain's plugged or something's wrong under there, wrong under there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T14:47:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is there a storm drain right at the puddle, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T14:47:43-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's one by the curb, hon, but the water just sits. Sits there. And now the cars are slowing down to a crawl going through it, a crawl. Everybody's creeping around it, around it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T14:47:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a problem, especially if somebody swerves into the other lane. Has it been like this the whole week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T14:48:06-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The whole week, hon, and it's wicked annoying. Somebody should've come by now, come by now. I'm not the only one on the street who's noticed it, noticed it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T14:48:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'm putting in a request for a crew to look at the drain and the low spot at three fifty Callender. Can I confirm a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T14:48:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's four oh one, five five five, oh one five seven. Oh one five seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T14:48:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one five seven. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T14:48:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Now, hon, do the crews work weekends? Because it's Thursday already and I don't want this sitting till Monday, till Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T14:48:53-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sometimes they do, but I can't promise you a day. I'm marking it as a standing-water problem with no rain, so it gets looked at in order. They'll see the note about traffic slowing down too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T14:49:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, okay. Please tell them it's getting worse, getting worse. I'm tired of looking at it, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T14:49:16-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you, Mrs. Rocha. It's in the system now. If it's still there come Monday, call us back and we'll follow up on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T14:49:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I will, hon. Thank you. Bye now, bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T14:49:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
